# Ars Magica Fifth Edition, Transforming Mythic Europe — Front Matter (Lore)

**Version:** 0.5.0
**Source:** Transforming Mythic Europe (Atlas Games) — Ars Magica Fifth Edition, credits (p. 2)
**Publisher:** Atlas Games

> The credits, verbatim. The printed Contents (pp. 3–5, with the List of Inserts) is a finding aid for the
> book’s own pages and is not converted — every unit it lists is converted in its chapter. Page 1 is the cover
> and pages 142–143 are art, none of them with text; page 144 is the publisher’s advertisement of other books.

